    "notes": "Itemised clothing prices (Queue 5 / Unit Y). Until now prices.json carried only the monthly clothing_personal budget lines in living_costs_monthly; this table prices the actual garments catalogued in data/clothing.json, whose entries point here via price_ref — if the two ever disagree, this table wins and clothing.json is fixed. Prices are set so a band's normal replacement cycle stays inside its clothing_personal monthly budget (lower 600 / mid 1,500 / upper 5,000 NCr). ppe_set_construction is priced as the sum of its parts (helmet 750 + vest 600 + boots 1,800 + gloves 200). Uniform sets are employer-issued at hiring (GDD-09 §5); the price here is the replacement cost. All integer NCr (GDD-01 §8)."
